  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project - &#x2018;Increasing production of nutritious crops and value-added products and their availability, affordability, and accessibility to increase dietary diversity, nutrition, and food security&#x2019; - seeks to increase access to affordable, readily available diverse diets and improve livelihoods, nutrition and food security. The project will focus on promoting the OFSP value chain (i.e. production to marketing) in six districts: Bombali, Koinadugu, Kono, Port Loko, Tonkolili and Western Area Rural mainly implemented by HKI in strong collaboration with the Ministry of Agriculture and Forestry and the Sierra Leone Agricultural Research Institute.</narrative>
  </description>
